                                    text="&lt;p>Our flexible ways of working can help you work in ways most effective for you. Through Where We Work, our hybrid work model for office-based employees, you have predictable flexibility without sacrificing in-person collaboration.The model consists of 3 days in the office, and 2 days of remote work.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
